@reporter We've identified a case where the above issue can happen. It shows the same symptoms, such as that log message you shared.

We've prepared a patch [here](https://github.com/qdrant/qdrant/pull/4402), and plan to release a patch version including it in the upcoming days.

Again. Sorry for the inconvenience.

Same issue on 1.11.0.

